</statement>
<comment pinned="false">One sensor per port&#44; with the module&#39;s normal 3.3 V &#47; GND connections.&#10;A&#58; MAX31850 module on P12. B&#58; DS18B20 module on P13.&#10;A displayed -999 is a measurement failure&#44; never a temperature.</comment>
